## External Research Plan

Search in this order and record links plus takeaways:

1. Official documentation, release notes, and issue trackers for the relevant library/tool.
2. Papers, technical reports, benchmark repos, or reproduction notes about the same method/task.
3. GitHub issues, Discussions, Discourse, Stack Overflow, model/dataset forums, and other open-source community threads with similar symptoms.
4. Lower-confidence posts only if they include reproducible commands, logs, or maintainer comments.

Suggested query forms:

- `<library or method> <exact error or metric symptom>`
- `<model/task/dataset> <failure mode>`
- `<relevant function/class/config key> bug`
- `<paper or repo name> reproduction issue`

